63987" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384668 1145 "First, from the equation of the plane we get that the normal vector of $Π$ is $n=⟨5,2,1⟩.$\n\nNow, we solve the Cartesian equation of $Π$ for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x+2y+z-4 & =0 \\\\ z & =-5x-2y+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we put $x=0$ and $y=0$, we get $z=4.$ Hence, the point $P(0,0,4)$ lies on $Π.$ Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,0,4⟩.$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ (r-⟨0,0,4⟩)\\cdot ⟨5,\\,2\\,,1⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384669 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384670 13194139536123 true] [17592186384669 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536123 true] [17592186384669 1041 "field-1" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384669 1104 #edb/ref 17592186384670 13194139536123 true] [17592186384669 1110 #uuid "b27f8f14-201a-514c-be9b-ed56526f88d6" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384670 1034 "4" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384670 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536123 true] [17592186384670 1111 #uuid "7d0eb7ad-9b50-5dc6-8b87-7f76312128ea" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384672 13194139536123 true] [17592186384671 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536123 true] [17592186384671 1041 "field-2" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384671 1104 #edb/ref 17592186384672 13194139536123 true] [17592186384671 1110 #uuid "40f9f4ed-dcee-5879-891b-4aeea776472c" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384672 1034 "5" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536123 true] [17592186384672 1111 #uuid "e32d4500-7940-5053-86bb-fbf9704e32fb" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384673 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384674 13194139536123 true] [17592186384673 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536123 true] [17592186384673 1041 "field-3" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384673 1104 #edb/ref 17592186384674 13194139536123 true] [17592186384673 1110 #uuid "c7ce9af2-3886-50d4-8ccd-8959a18d4900" 13194139536123 true] [17592186384674 1034 "1" 131941395